Sirt3 sulfhydration has been reported in multiple systems. In a model of chemotherapy-induced toxicity, human kidney cells (HK-2) or AKI mice were treated with cisplatin; basal levels of Sirt3 sulfhydration decreased, but rebounded upon NaHS treatment (
